---
title: "transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_sig: caller invokes transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization(from, to, signature)
    q_check_sig --> q_error_sig: signature verification fails (not from authorized Legion signer)
    q_error_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_sig --> q_check_from: signature valid
    q_check_from --> q_error_from: position[from].investedCapital == 0
    q_error_from --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: position[from] exists
    q_check_to --> q_error_to: position[to].investedCapital > 0
    q_error_to --> [*]: revert PositionAlreadyExists
    q_check_to --> q_transfer_pos: position[to] is empty
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_old: position[to] = position[from]
    q_clear_old --> q_emit: delete position[from]
    q_emit --> [*]: emit InvestorPositionTransferred(from, to)

    note right of q_check_sig
        INV-001: Cryptographic authorization replaces operator-only access control
        INV-002: Same position transfer semantics as transferInvestorPosition
        INV-003: Signature must come from authorized Legion signer (not arbitrary EOA)
    end note
